# 🎮 Free Game Radar

**Never miss a free game. Never miss your wishlist's lowest price.**

A cross-platform game giveaway and price tracking application
that monitors free game promotions across multiple PC game stores,
tracks Steam wishlist discounts, and sends real-time notifications.

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.12+-blue)
![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-Backend-009688)
![Flutter](https://img.shields.io/badge/Flutter-Cross--Platform-02569B)
![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-In%20Development-orange)

## 📖 Overview

Free Game Radar is a personal project designed to help gamers
keep track of free PC games and game discounts across multiple
digital storefronts.

The application automatically monitors supported game stores,
detects new giveaways, tracks promotion expiration times,
and sends notifications before free offers expire.

It also includes a Steam wishlist monitoring system that tracks
price changes, historical prices, discounts, and target prices.

## ✨ Features

### 🎁 Free Game Monitoring
- Multi-platform giveaway monitoring.
- Free-to-keep detection.
- Free weekend detection.
- Promotion expiration tracking.

### ⏳ Giveaway Countdown
- Real-time countdown.
- Configurable expiration reminders.
- Automatic expiration detection.

### ❤️ Steam Wishlist
- Steam wishlist integration where accessible.
- Manual game addition.
- Wishlist synchronization.

### 📉 Steam Price Tracker
- Current price monitoring.
- Discount detection.
- Historical price tracking.
- Recorded lowest price detection.
- Target price alerts.

### 🔔 Notifications
- New giveaway alerts.
- Giveaway expiration reminders.
- Wishlist discount alerts.
- Price drop alerts.
- Telegram notifications.

## 🛒 Supported Platforms

| Platform | Giveaway | Price Tracking | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
