## ⚠️ Limitations

- Platform integrations depend on available and permitted data sources.
- Some stores may not expose public giveaway APIs.
- Steam wishlist import may require a public profile.
- Historical price accuracy depends on data availability.
- Giveaway expiration times may change when updated by the store.
- Push notifications require platform-specific configuration.

